{"product_id":"goldilocks-and-the-three-bears-favourite-tales","title":"Goldilocks and the Three Bears (Favourite Tales)","description":"\u003cp\u003eOnce upon a time, there were three bears. There was a great big bear, a middle sized bear and a tiny little bear. One morning, the father bear made some porridge but it was too hot. So the bears went for a walk to allow the porridge to cool. Meanwhile Goldilocks came calling.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 123 x 180\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Audrey Daly\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780721415581\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738308075673,"sku":"15RE-3-9780721415581","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d0f12ca484b_Goldilocks_and_the_Three_Bears__Favourite_Tales__Audrey_Daly.jpg?v=1758563287","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/goldilocks-and-the-three-bears-favourite-tales","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}